  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 904.08 Other Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 904.08 Other Requirements. Limbs and recognizable organs, excluding teeth and contiguous gum tissue, shall be disposed of by incineration or interment.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 900); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2604.08); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
